    "CANDIDATES, NOT VERIFIED SOURCES. Nothing here reaches the app until",
    "scripts/resolve-music-sources.mjs resolves each name against the YouTube",
    "Data API, confirms the channel exists and publishes eligible music, and",
    "writes it into content/media-source-review.json with a channel id, an",
    "avatar and a sample video as proof.",
    "",
    "These names were gathered from the listed references. A reference proves",
    "only that the name was published somewhere, never that a given YouTube",
    "channel belongs to that artist — that is the resolver's job. Names that",
    "do not resolve are reported for manual review, never guessed at.",
    "",
    "'languages' is the language the artist is reported to record in and is",
    "applied to the source only once the channel itself is confirmed.",
    "",
    "Read 'excluded' before adding anyone back: it records artists who were",
    "deliberately left out and why."
  ],
